sick-worker: worked together with k21 (same module, same tests).

sick-worker: done with k21, same tree. intermediates_pem: each block (except the root itself) must be CA:TRUE and verify to ca.root with the other blocks as untrusted. Drift (not in scope): SICK::Trust::_intermediates checks the chain to the root but not CA:TRUE, so a leaf of the root given by another issuer would be published as intermediate.

